@staydesk_HostAddress = http://localhost:5225
@staydesk_ApiAddress = {{staydesk_HostAddress}}/api
@authToken = REPLACE_WITH_VALID_JWT

### Health Check
GET {{staydesk_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Login
POST {{staydesk_ApiAddress}}/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Rooms
GET {{staydesk_ApiAddress}}/rooms
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
